# Chemistry (example rule)

Install into `.cursor/rules/` **only** if deploy checklist G1 = yes.

- Canonical isomeric SMILES; validate on create/import.
- Store agreed descriptors + Morgan FP on write; recompute when SMILES changes.
- Generate 2D depictions on review — **never** store images in the DB.
- RDKit multi-reactant reactions: try relevant orderings; dedupe products; soft-cancel if long.
